WEBVTT

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.170
Helicopters sure can fly,

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.330
but they don't have wings so I hate them.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.740
Jeez, every single time.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:34.020
Won't you and your boys ever learn to travel in a normal fashion, Boris?

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.430
Indeed we aren't military, yet we aren't civilians either.

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.260
As such, traveling through normal channels is troublesome.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:43.360
So, what do you require of us?

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.230
I think it's far too early for Yomi's regular meeting.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.790
This is an order from the leader of Yami.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:50.580
I need you to go wild for a bit.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.820
I have a principle.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:55.520
Aside from my master, I do not follow orders from others.

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:58.180
He instructed me to come here, so here I am.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.120
But we will not move an inch unless he orders us to do so.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.770
I've wanted to say this for a long time.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.100
Boris...

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.530
That camo uniform,

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.550
stands out like a prick in public, doesn't it?

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:14.080
Doesn't it?

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:15.630
<i>Yes, I understand master.</i>

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.630
Doesn't it?

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:19.390
We shall return under Yomi's command by 2300 hours.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:23.020
Leader Kanou, we await your orders.

00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:24.980
Boris Ivanov,

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:27.020
I totally hate you.

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:34.230
If your wish ever comes true,

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:34.230
君の願いが叶うその時

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:34.230
Kimi no negai ga kanau sono toki

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:42.680
then go ahead and assume that my dream has also come true.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:42.680
私の夢も叶うと信じて

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:42.680
Watashi no yume mo kanau to shinjite

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:48.780
Kenichi

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:48.780
SubDESU

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:48.780
History's Strongest Disciple

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:48.780
Presents

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:53.870
I know that you have been choosing,

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:53.870
いつだって遠回りする道を

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:53.870
Itsudatte toomawari suru michi wo

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.600
roundabout paths constantly.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.600
選び続けたことも知ってる

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.600
Erabi tsuduketa koto mo shitteru

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:03.630
I also know how you always try to smile,

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:03.630
誰よりも傷ついてる時でも

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:03.630
Dare yori mo kizutsuiteru toki de mo

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:09.880
even though it's you who's hurt the most!

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:09.880
笑ってみせることも私は知ってる

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:09.880
Waratte miseru koto mo watashi wa shitteru

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:13.530
I then look up,

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:13.530
何も言わず星を

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:13.530
Nani mo iwazu hoshi wo

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:17.400
gazing silently at the stars...

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:17.400
見つめてるとなり ...

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:17.400
Mitsumeteru to nari ...

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:20.880
祈るを捧ぐ

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:20.880
Inoru wo sasagu

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:20.880
And offer my prayer.

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:25.940
If your wish ever comes true,

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:25.940
君の願いが叶うその時

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:25.940
Kimi no negai ga kanau sono toki

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:30.870
my tears would definitely end up spilling.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:30.870
私の涙こぼれるでしょう

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:30.870
Watashi no namida koboreru deshou

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:35.400
No matter when, I will always look at you,

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:35.400
どんな時でも見つめてるよ

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:35.400
Donna toki de mo mitsumeteru yo

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:41.770
because it's you who taught me the power of belief.

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:41.770
信じる強さ教えてくれた

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:41.770
Shinjiru tsuyosa oshiete kureta

