00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.450
Your latest time has improved since the last attempt.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:23.090
Seems you're getting better and better with your escape attempts, eh?

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.890
I guess it's all thanks to his daily hellish training,

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:29.020
that he has developed suck quick feet, wouldn't you say?

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:32.920
It is no laughing matter that his impressive abilities as an escape artist,

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.440
are directly proportional to the amount of hardships he went through during training.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.710
I fully agree.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:39.490
I wish he would actually apply those skills in combat as well.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:41.970
Hey, Ken-chan!

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:46.440
Being surrounded by this many masters at the same time,

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:49.100
it's something that even an emperor wouldn't experience in his lifetime.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.240
Why would you even contemplate the thought of escaping?

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.760
I'm not trying to escape!

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:57.260
I just want a little break!

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:01.780
But in order for you to survive the upcoming battle with the Yami,

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:05.130
you need to train, without rest, to the death!

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:08.880
To the death? I think I've already been there many times!

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:09.690
And whenever that happens,

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:12.210
I always seem to be resurrected by some suspicious medicine.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:15.140
Here, take this secret medicine that will call you back to the land of the living.

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:19.730
Don't I have any civil rights?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.870
Disciples trained here are no longer considered as humans!

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.360
Disciples trained here are no longer considered as humans.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.450
Disciples trained here are no longer considered as humans

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:31.530
He jumped off!

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:33.370
Kenichi-san!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.160
That sure was a loud thud.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:38.460
Think he's dead?

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:42.960
No, I don't think he was trained so lightly to die from a fall like that.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.750
Alright, I've successfully evaded them all.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.020
Now if I could just evade them till I get to my hiding spot.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:52.170
H{*\3c&HABC3CE&}i{*\3c&H9FBBCA&}g{*\3c&H93B3C6&}h{*\3c&H87ABC1&}-{*\3c&H7BA3BD&}s{*\3c&H6E9BB9&}p{*\3c&H6293B4&}e{*\3c&H568BB0&}e{*\3c&H4A83AC&}d {*\3c&H437FAA&}l{*\3c&H4983AD&}i{*\3c&H4E87B0&}b{*\3c&H548BB2&}e{*\3c&H598FB5&}r{*\3c&H5F94B8&}a{*\3c&H6498BA&}t{*\3c&H6A9CBD&}i{*\3c&H6FA0C0&}o{*\3c&H75A4C3&}n {*\3c&H80ADC8&}D{*\3c&H85B1CB&}a{*\3c&H8BB5CD&}s{*\3c&H90B9D0&}h{*\3c&H96BDD3&}!

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:01.660
Oh, you dug just enough for me to get through, eh?

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.170
Thanks for the assist, Tochuumaru-sama!

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.840
I won't ever forget this favor.

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:16.150
Did you properly tag him with the transmitter?

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:30.840
No, it's not like I quit Ryouzanpaku or something.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:32.170
It's just like, well...

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:34.590
Steps to ensure self preservation?

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:38.360
Because after all, I am the one who knows my body best.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:41.280
It would sadden my masters if I got injured or handicapped.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:45.930
So taking a break like this could also be considered as a sign of loyalty to my teachers.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:49.830
I don't remember asking for an explanation about your circumstances.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.910
What I am asking you is, why of all places, would you come to my house at this hour?!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.620
Because they know where my I live,

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.050
and I had nowhere else to go but here.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:01.790
We're best friends after all, right?

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:03.790
What "best friends" crap are you spouting about?!

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.030
Leave at once!

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:08.040
But look, you even prepared tea for me.

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:09.720
<i>Crap.</i>

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.590
I'm great at preparing tea, see?

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:16.270
I'll be the one to prepare it, so stop already.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:20.290
<i>It's all his stupid sister's fault that I got into the habit of preparing tea!</i>

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:21.530
Wait...

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:23.600
Did your sister tell you the address of this place?

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:27.290
I'm pretty sure I registered a false address at school.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:28.950
Nope, she didn't.

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:31.370
I told him.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:34.800
I didn't want an important pawn to be destroyed by rival groups.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.250
Why you...!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.160
Why did you do such a thing?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:42.200
Anyway, I never thought that you two were that close to actually invite each other over.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:43.670
I never invited him.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.710
He just followed me here.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:51.030
I am helping him find out the whereabouts of his master.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.580
Here, a fresh report.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.990
What? Did you learn something already?

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:01.420
He was last seen working for the Chinese state mafia?

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.440
This is what I wanted to know.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.990
So he's searching for him...

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:08.820
Wait a minute,

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.020
how did you get in?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.200
With a key?

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:19.080
My head's starting to spin.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:21.750
I got a few more spare btw.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.210
<i>Quite a twist of fate for him to have met this alien.</i>

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.000
Also, though this is of another matter,

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.420
but my loyal servant, and a hired investigator,

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:33.480
dug up some new information about Yomi.

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.720
Don't tell me, you are also investigating Yami?

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:41.940
We don't even have a single clue about this Yami group, so an investigation is totally out of the question.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:45.470
It's even highly likely that such an organization doesn't exist in the first place.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.410
Do not attempt to learn about Yami.

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:49.270
Got it?

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:50.490
You absolutely must not.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.910
<i>So even  </i>this<i> guy is scared of them?</i>

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.240
<i>Seems like they can't be taken lightly.</i>

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.680
So, what did you learn about Yami's satellite group, the Yomi?

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.090
Huh? Well...

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:04.230
Two of their members names.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.580
Let's see,

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:09.780
their leader is nicknamed "the beautiful winged one, Sparna" .

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.170
His real name is Kanou Shou.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.100
<i>Kanou Shou...</i>

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.000
That damn guy kissed her!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.860
What the...?!

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.020
Old wounds.

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:21.510
That damn guy kissed her!

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:22.330
That damn guy kissed her!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:24.450
The other guy is a Russian,

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.770
his name is...

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:26.650
Boris.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.520
You know him?

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.630
Boris Ivanov.

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.280
So he's here, huh?

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.030
Mission complete.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:40.920
We'll put up the black flag as planned.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:44.330
Now there are 36 <i>dojo's</i>  under Yami.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:44.330
TL: Dojo - School for training in Japanese arts of self-defense.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.750
Using strange fighting techniques...

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.330
Just who the hell are you?

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:52.970
My name is Boris Ivanov.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:55.700
Russia's current strongest Command SAMBO user.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:59.720
Alexander's best disciple.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:07.090
The time has come for Yami to grasp the world.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.820
There are two reasons for destroying those <i>dojos</i>.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.490
The first is to show our declaration of war against Ryouzanpaku.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.490
The other is to signal the start of that war to the other martial arts groups.

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:20.070
My beloved Yomi members.

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:21.740
Welcome to Japan.

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:23.620
The time has come.

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:26.010
Still just the three of us?

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.010
Well I guess this meeting was arranged on short notice.

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:30.010
I do not like this.

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:32.460
Why should we declare war here in Japan?

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.460
By the order of Yami.

