Chinese Kenpo{MIssing one sign 中国拳法 that chinese martial art/Kung fu one}

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:48.480
that cannot be learned in Japan.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.330
As a result, with the bubble era's collapse,

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:52.110
the trails of martial arts styles that remain,

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:54.870
were all concentrated in this one place.

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:56.120
And in this country,

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.360
the mass media is a giant revolving machine.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.180
I see.

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:01.090
In other words,

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:03.070
this is the perfect place to go all out,

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:06.410
if we want to be known all over the world, right?

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.730
Bingo!

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:10.210
Besides, orders from the higher ups are absolute.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.370
Let's do this smartly.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:16.130
So, how many of the <i>dojos</i>  in the documents I gave you have already been cleaned up?

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.760
They're a collective pile of trash.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.480
It's thirteen for me.

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:22.110
Ten for me.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:24.390
Ah, I got twelve.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.520
Huh? What about Boris?

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.150
Where is he?

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:32.260
Did you properly relay the "mission complete" message to him, leader?

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:36.150
If you didn't, he's going to keep on destroying <i>dojos</i>.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:38.710
This is the 58th.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:43.830
Commander, we have already destroyed all of the <i>dojos</i>  down to the last name on the list..

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:44.880
What are we going to do now?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:51.910
We'll destroy all of them again starting from the first one!

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:52.920
Yes sir!

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.020
Wait... 58?

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.270
Let me see the list.

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:58.120
Here.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.190
You fool!

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:03.840
There is still one left.

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:06.390
I am very sorry sir!

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.850
We almost came close to ruining the plan.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.960
Damn, where is his communicator?!

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:12.680
Who knows?

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:13.850
I have no idea.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.980
At least buy a mobile phone, dammit!

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.220
Okay, we'll be heading there now!

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:19.190
Move out! {Everyone}

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:20.290
Yes sir!

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:28.420
{PArt B start HEre}

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.510
Can't you understand Japanese?

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:39.630
I told you to leave as soon as the sun rises.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:44.600
Now now, you did allow me sanctuary after my escape from Ryouzanpaku after all.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.890
At least allow me to pay back the favor by making you a meal.

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:51.430
I don't need any of your bad tasting dishes.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:52.710
It doesn't taste bad.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:54.980
He's been helping Miu out,

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.060
so he's quite good at it.

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.020
Yeah, you're right.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:58.010
Wha–?!

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:01.400
You won't get strong if you don't eat breakfast.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.430
Yep yep.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:04.760
I'm digging in–...

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:07.270
He's here!

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:11.370
Too late for you to hide there, Apachai-san!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.160
Wh-Why are you here?

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:14.730
Transmitter.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:17.180
What? When did this...?

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:19.330
Is this Ma-san's doing?

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.030
Apachai-san.

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:26.170
Apa...?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.690
We'll be having hamburgers tonight,

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:32.050
so please tell them that I escaped to the west, okay?

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:33.030
Apa!

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:35.810
Hey, what kind of place do you think this is?!

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:38.820
Ah Tanimoto-kun, the school's Honor Student,

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.580
you'll be late if you don't get going soon.

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:43.180
<i>This guy can be really crazy.</i>

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.140
You're coming along!

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.820
I'm going to hand you over to Furinji personally.

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:50.360
No, let me go!

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:51.400
Don't take me there!

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:52.480
I don't want to see Miu-san right now!

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:53.510
I don't want to see Miu-san right now!!

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:54.410
What's with him?

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:55.350
He just got so energetic.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.890
You can't knock out Kenichi with just that.

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:04.710
<i>Faint~</i>

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:07.810
These days you have to at least use this much force for it to actually work.

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:09.470
<i>They sure have a frightening relationship.</i>

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.730
How rare Shirahama,

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:14.790
you're not wearing the uniform today.

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.210
You got the wrong person.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.410
<i>She's mad.</i>

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:25.610
<i>This is the end.</i>

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:29.990
Your lunch.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.630
Miu-san, you're not mad?

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:33.990
Mad? Even to me,

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:37.620
your training these past days looked very tough.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:40.810
You'll surely die if you're not forced to rest.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.810
I'm relieved...

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:44.500
<i>What are they whispering about?</i>

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:50.860
Besides, about Yomi's leader that we met the botanical garden,

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:54.500
you never told anyone in Ryouzanpaku about it, right?

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:59.930
So I'll also keep the details regarding your escape under wraps.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:01.890
Miu-san.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:05.750
So you're still holding that earring close, huh?

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:09.510
No, umm... this is...

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:11.900
This is in case that I run into him somewhere,

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:14.280
I can quickly exchange it back for my hairpin.

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:18.280
Could dangerous-smelling men be your type, Miu-san?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.710
What are you saying? Jeez!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.010
<i>He said something about "type"!</i>

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.040
<i>And they're acting close!</i>

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.760
Disappointment

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:29.720
Anyway, you must return within two or three days.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:33.670
You won't be able to hold off the storm for long just by just bribing Apachai-san's stomach.

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:35.430
This is bad.

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:37.230
When I got to the transmitter's location,

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.480
I found it was attached to a car!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.360
And it was all the way in Kyoto!

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.360
What?

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.750
So he noticed it.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:46.220
I'm going to eat hamburgers tonight.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:50.200
Kenichi sure is good at cooking.

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:53.860
Cooking Club

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:53.860
Shinpaku Alliance HQ

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:55.680
Your efforts aren't enough!

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:56.880
Shinpaku!

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:58.110
Louder!

00:14:58.110 --> 00:14:59.350
Shinpaku!

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:03.450
Move your body as fast as a cockroach!

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:08.480
Captain and vice-captain are going through hellish training right now,

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:13.510
and yet, all that you underlings have to do is collect and tag information only!

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:15.950
The internet isn't some sort of morse code!

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.710
Try harder and dive deeper!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.030
Shinpaku!

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:21.270
Sh-Shinpaku~

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.450
I've brought captain escapee here.

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:28.510
Still, your training here is really something.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:30.650
It feels like the real thing has already started.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:34.530
It's all for Shinpaku Alliance's upcoming second phase.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.780
Second phase?

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.020
Hey you!

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:38.170
Don't just slack off there!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:38.790
Shinpaku!

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:40.330
That's right.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.450
Defeating Yomi,

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:43.720
will successfully hit Yami where it hurts the most and thus

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:46.440
our judicial foundation will finally be established!

