00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:36.710
They got caught in the trap that was supposed to be for Kenichi.

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:39.500
Oops, I forgot to clean it up.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.110
That's probably the newspaper guy.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:42.500
I see.

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:43.580
